                        "name": "Andrew Geissler",
                        "email": "geissonator@yahoo.com",
                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "This series of documents under the development directory were written to provide the basic steps for a new developer to OpenBMC to get a taste of the development flow. I feel that adding in another option to these docs just makes it confusing for a new developer. I'd prefer we stick with Romulus as the only thing discussed in here as we know it is supported because our CI infrastructure utilizes it. I'd lean more toward what you have in here going out in https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/master/meta-evb/meta-evb-aspeed/meta-evb-ast2600/README.md"
                },
                {
